1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:02,591
(Sheldon:)Once while he was trying to watch
The Incredibles.

2
00:00:03,672 --> 00:00:05,042
(Sheldon:)Penny.

3
00:00:06,708 --> 00:00:08,108
(Sheldon:)Hello.

4
00:00:08,276 --> 00:00:09,536
(Sheldon:)So, Penny, I understand...

5
00:00:09,711 --> 00:00:13,411
...you'd like to learn more about flags.
- I can't tell you how many times...

6
00:00:13,582 --> 00:00:17,912
...I've been at a party, everyone's talking
about flags and I just couldn't join in.

7
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:21,180
(Sheldon:)Well, you came to the right place.

8
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:26,919
(Penny:)I'm sorry, can we just pause for a minute?

9
00:00:28,763 --> 00:00:29,893
(Sheldon:)What's wrong?

10
00:00:30,065 --> 00:00:33,625
I think it'd look more natural
if you talked to me instead of the camera.

11
00:00:33,868 --> 00:00:35,568
You know, like a real conversation?

12
00:00:35,737 --> 00:00:37,797
(Penny:)It's something we work on
in acting class.

13
00:00:38,006 --> 00:00:39,026
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

14
00:00:39,507 --> 00:00:44,137
(Sheldon:)A few people in the Comments section
have said that my delivery is robotic.

15
00:00:45,947 --> 00:00:48,277
(Sheldon:)Perhaps that isn't the compliment
it sounds like.

16
00:00:49,618 --> 00:00:53,148
Let's try it again. Maybe this time
you could work on body language a bit.

17
00:00:53,321 --> 00:00:56,411
When you're hunched like that,
you're shutting the audience out.

